      "content": "i know about the hotlines, thanks. but they don't pay the mortgage. they don't fix the fact that i've failed everyone. my family, my kids... they're gonna see me lose everything and it's just gonna be this endless cycle of shame. it feels like i've run out of options. like there's just a wall in front of me and i can't get past it no matter how hard i try.",
